 which is used to disinfect the current infected Xcode project. The calling condition of is (Figure 22), but as mentioned earlier, currently the variable\u2019s value is false."]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--bab7c8ab-95d0-5490-b725-f363508a1825","120":"instance--ef6144f5-ea6f-5d87-9a48-0b74193fafd9","150":"instance--4127c4d5-92d8-584e-9280-6d914733b4d1","180":"instance--c7ef3823-aa06-5991-8491-8925c692edfc","210":"instance--624e0f8b-2d32-5914-99e5-57389231d390","240":"instance--e73a9dc8-db9f-5ab5-b7c9-3f5bf91bdac0","270":"instance--3a6569b9-9d13-5798-9d89-3e56f4e80b45","30":"instance--730326ee-06de-53c0-809a-b8faed2639a5","300":"instance--f0deed91-b7f6-5696-9226-2b929fa8a746","330":"instance--550312ae-aaf8-5725-9d74-989e02ed5b3f","60":"instance--c9ada904-cf0f-5f57-9500-ac3bc4fb7f68","90":"instance--988af48d-e29a-56e7-a847-8996d5c8aa3b"},"id":"file","instance":"file--replicator-applescript","properties":[["value","replicator.applescript"],["evidence",[["item-1",{"excerpt":"The replicator.applescript module infects Xcode developer projects by inserting a function that calls its malicious components during the build phase or the build rule.","source":"https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/21/d/xcsset-quickly-adapts-to-macos-11-and-m1-based-macs.html"}]]],["display_name","replicator.applescript"],["name","replicator.applescript"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a0fdef79-e436-58d1-8025-356ee91ad122","120":"instance--96d617f2-9c74-55fc-ac19-5da49240a3f1","150":"instance--3fdebfb0-21c9-58f2-8b43-c3908040a478","180":"instance--ec22b7a6-31a2-58d1-98e6-3d7f1878efc6","210":"instance--1699a6f3-a3e6-5cd6-8f7b-90fa6b66efac","240":"instance--3dad152c-6c95-5fa5-9b2b-619741bfe72b","270":"instance--8f3b21a7-4068-5f5b-845a-d5cd5bf46a62","30":"instance--d58ebce9-49f1-5700-af95-10f2287378b9","300":"instance--170dc175-73d2-5841-9d5f-58c713978f9a","330":"instance--c9161380-acd5-56bf-b621-1377eea5a042","60":"instance--22830fd4-4c23-5fb3-8298-9de5f2620107","90":"instance--9e025ffa-05b6-552